# Market data is not committed: files are large, often licensed, and the
# repository must not become a redistribution of vendor data.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored `data/` also matches
# src/nqlab/data/ — the source package — and silently drops it from the commit.
/data/
*.parquet
*.csv
!tests/**/*.csv

models/
mlruns/
.DS_Store
